                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Hold it right there, traveller. This shoulder of the road is mine to watch, and nobody walks the caravan leg without showing me a team."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The Company patrols got thick past the crossing, so I stopped trusting anyone I have not battled. Draw."
                        }
